30
*SHELL SECTION, ELSET=manhole_surf, MATERIAL=Aluminum
30

*STEP
*STATIC
0.1, 1, 1E-05, 1E+30

*BOUNDARY, OP=NEW
bottom_ring, 1, 6, 0
top_ring, 1, 1, 0
